    "text": "MaxPreps\nwebsite\nLesterville\nVolleyball Recap: Lesterville Takes a Loss\nBy Team Reports,\n16 hours agoLesterville was not able to break out of their rough patch on Monday as the team picked up their sixth straight loss. They came up short against the Winona Wildcats, falling 3-0. The result was an unpleasant reminder to the Bearcats of the 3-0 defeat they experienced in the pair's previous head-to-head fixture back in September of 2024.",
